T #d6caa0 hall
U #1f5458 hall
V #3a8a86 hall
W #6a3a62 hall
X #74acd8 hall
Y #c6e4f0 hall

# London: rainy evening. Wet slate grey-blues outside, rain
# highlights, phone-box and bus red, bottle-green upholstery, amber lamplight.
Z #2a3a4a london
a #3c4c5e london
b #62788c london
c #a2b6c4 london
d #c41e24 london
e #23402e london
f #a8641a london
g #eea03a london
h #ffdc8e london

# Zurich: clear night. Plum walls, night-sky and lake navies,
